<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that you're unhappy with the fare you were quoted for travel from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}} to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>Fare prices online</strong></p>

<p>While making a booking online fares can fluctuate, view our <a href="https://help.qantas.com/support/s/article/Session-timed-out-whilst-booking-online">FAQ</a>&nbsp;for more information.</p>

<p><br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We've always been proud of our industry leading standards of safety and have a continuing commitment to innovative technology and service excellence.<br />
<br />
We offer complimentary in-flight dining and refreshments on every flight and our customers benefit from additional services such as our comprehensive Frequent Flyer program and world-class lounge facilities.<br />
<br />
While we are a premium airline, we often have sale fares available for our customers via our website and distributed throughout the travel agent community.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
While we have no plans to change our fare structure in the immediate future, I've passed your comments on to our Pricing Management for internal review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard soon.</p>
